<!-- WHO KEEPS THIS AGREEMENT -->
<section class="content-section" id="guidelines-keeper">
    <div class="content-wrapper">
        <h2>Who Keeps This Agreement</h2>
        <p>
            Brother Aaron Powner, an ordained Elder in The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day
            Saints, serves as the Ministering Elder of Words of Plainness. He teaches these
            expectations, moderates our gatherings, and keeps this agreement. His role here rests
            on the agreement each participant makes by taking part. It claims no authority over
            any person’s faith or church. Words of Plainness is an independent ministry and does
            not speak for any church. He is bound by this agreement like everyone else, and seeks
            to keep it “by persuasion, by long-suffering, by gentleness and meekness, and by love
            unfeigned” (D&amp;C 121:41).
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- IN OUR DISCORD SERVER -->
<section class="content-section alt" id="guidelines-discord">
    <div class="content-wrapper">
        <h2>In Our Discord Server</h2>
        <p>
            Each chapter of Words of Plainness has its own dedicated discussion channel. Keep
            conversation in those channels focused on the chapter: the ideas, the scriptures, the
            questions it raises. General conversation belongs in <strong>#general</strong>.
            Questions for Brother Aaron belong in <strong>#ask-brother-aaron</strong>.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

